	"notes": [
		{
			"id": "n7zvmzu6KfXLeKlih",
			"text": "Typical Stats from the package record: ST 24, DX 13, IQ 3, HT 13, HP 24, WILL 9, PER 10, FP 13, SPEED 6.5, MOVE 6, DODGE 9, DR 2. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
		},
		{
			"id": "nRLnqS4AFBy-lEdoj",
			"text": "Encounter rating: CER 43 (offense 22, protection 21), threat tier standard, appearing 2."
		},
		{
			"id": "nG80XaZ3NoAHNg0KI",
			"text": "GCS ancestry draft: gcs/megaraptor.gct"
		},
		{
			"id": "nzllWBLZXrKCTKJ1p",
			"text": "Independent build total: 7 points of racial traits plus 12 points of racial skills."
		},
		{
			"id": "neQ1kR3MiNZti2ZMx",
			"text": "Answers the SRD heading(s): Megaraptor (SRD 3.5). Only the creature identity is taken from the SRD; the GURPS statistics, ratings and prose are this project's own work and reproduce no SRD text."
		},
		{
			"id": "nv41dU0ruIkFuUOZz",
			"text": "Typical Stats, damage and ratings are derived from the racial template, not authored beside it, so the sheet and the stat block cannot disagree."
		},
		{
			"id": "nQ4TKjsfjFAzT2CRS",
			"text": "Body mass used to scale this build: 500 kg. ST, Size Modifier and DR are checked against it; see the gurps-animal-sanity-check skill for the bands."
		},
		{
			"id": "nmT5BdNFbiTMrcn3n",
			"text": "Movement: ground Move 6, 9 at a sprint (primary). The published Move is the primary medium's cruising Move; sprint figures are stated here and not folded into it."
		},
		{
			"id": "n0jRX3kscnjgY5dVI",
			"text": "Treasure and grappling are not authored for this batch and ship as explicit nulls; `lair` carries a short habitat note, because where a wandering animal dens is an encounter fact rather than a loot one."
		},
		{
			"id": "nN2w9gC4QADRIEa8O",
			"text": "Five metres nose to tail, which is the SM +2 row."
		},
		{
			"id": "nPfDK8hj9Nx5-KjMs",
			"text": "ST from Basic Lift: it tears a limb off something the weight of a horse."
		},
		{
			"id": "n328K5a1WqcTI4nIe",
			"text": "Added after a post-hoc comparison against independent GURPS fan conversions of this creature: the Tracking skill, which a creature with Discriminatory Smell should always have. The comparison surfaced the gap; the build is still ours."
		},
		{
			"id": "nuALqhq7U4o6eUMOb",
			"text": "Monster statistics, ratings and description prose by Monsters on Automatic; AI-generated first draft, project-reviewed, released under CC BY 4.0."
		}
	],
